{{Term/Store|Hotfeather Pigeon|Hotfeather Pigeons|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|'''Hotfeather Pigeon'''|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|'''Hotfeather Pigeon'''|Hyrule Compendium|TotK}}</ref>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Hotfeather Pigeon}}
Hotfeather Pigeons are rare breed of [[Pigeon]].<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= |book= CaC |publisher= |page= 164}}</ref><ref name="Compendium">{{Cite|This rare breed of pigeon lives near Death Mountain. Their fireproof feathers are valuable as clothing material. Their meat, on the other hand, is not fireproof, and it'll burn up as soon as it's struck.|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref> They can mainly be found in areas surrounding [[Death Mountain]], particularly the [[Eldin Canyon]] and [[Eldin Mountains]].<ref name="Compendium"/> They drop [[Raw Bird Thigh]]s when they are killed. While their feathers are fireproof and used to make clothing, their [[Meat]] will burn when exposed to a [[Scorching Climate]].<ref name="Compendium"/>

